// Written by tools/movement/onetime (docs/plans/bodies-and-movement.md, phase 1 step 11):
// don't edit it by hand. The walk: ACCAD's Male 2 walking (Open Motion Project by ACCAD/The
// Ohio State University, CC BY 3.0), as it was retargeted to Quaternius's rig and fitted as a
// cycle of each bone's turn (this file before, in git), each of its frames fitted to the
// creature's joints (`engine::body::fit`) and then fitted as a Fourier series of each number,
// in place.

